---
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout
  title="Página no encontrada | Ferreras SMP"
  description="La página que buscas no existe. Vuelve al blog, consulta cómo entrar o regresa al inicio de Ferreras SMP."
  noindex
  includeCanonical={false}
>
  <Header />
  <main id="contenido" class="not-found-page">
    <section class="not-found-hero">
      <div class="shell not-found-layout">
        <div class="not-found-code mono" aria-hidden="true">404</div>
        <div class="not-found-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Página no encontrada</p>
          <h1>Este camino no lleva a ninguna parte.</h1>
          <p>Puede que el enlace esté incompleto o que el contenido ya no exista. El mundo de Ferreras SMP sigue justo donde lo dejaste.</p>
          <div class="not-found-actions">
            <a class="button button-primary" href="/blog">Volver al blog</a>
            <a class="button button-secondary" href="/">Ir al inicio</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="not-found-options" aria-labelledby="options-title">
      <div class="shell">
        <p class="eyebrow">También puedes</p>
        <h2 id="options-title">Retomar desde un lugar conocido.</h2>
        <div class="not-found-grid">
          <a href="/blog">
            <span class="mono">01</span>
            <div><h3>Leer las guías</h3><p>Consulta artículos sobre Minecraft Java, survival y acceso a servidores.</p></div>
            <strong aria-hidden="true">→</strong>
          </a>
          <a href="/como-entrar">
            <span class="mono">02</span>
            <div><h3>Entrar al servidor</h3><p>Copia la IP y sigue los pasos para añadir Ferreras SMP.</p></div>
            <strong aria-hidden="true">→</strong>
          </a>
          <a href="/preguntas-frecuentes">
            <span class="mono">03</span>
            <div><h3>Resolver una duda</h3><p>Revisa las respuestas rápidas sobre acceso, mods y servidor.</p></div>
            <strong aria-hidden="true">→</strong>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .not-found-page {
    min-height: 70vh;
  }

  .not-found-hero {
    padding-block: clamp(80px, 12vw, 160px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  }

  .not-found-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(260px, 0.62fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(48px, 9vw, 130px);
  }

  .not-found-code {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: clamp(8rem, 20vw, 16rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.1em;
    line-height: 0.75;
  }

  .not-found-copy h1 {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.8rem);
    line-height: 0.96;
    letter-spacing: -0.075em;
  }

  .not-found-copy > p:last-of-type {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    color: var(--muted-strong);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.15rem);
  }

  .not-found-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .not-found-options {
    padding-block: clamp(72px, 9vw, 120px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--card-elevated) 68%, var(--background));
  }

  .not-found-options h2 {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-bottom: clamp(42px, 6vw, 68px);
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
  }

  .not-found-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .not-found-grid > a {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;
    min-height: 240px;
    gap: 28px;
    padding: 28px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .not-found-grid > a:last-child {
    border-right: 0;
  }

  .not-found-grid > a:hover {
    background: var(--card);
  }

  .not-found-grid > a > span {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .not-found-grid h3 {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 19px;
  }

  .not-found-grid p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .not-found-grid strong {
    position: absolute;
    right: 28px;
    bottom: 24px;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .not-found-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .not-found-code {
      font-size: clamp(7rem, 30vw, 11rem);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .not-found-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .not-found-grid > a {
      min-height: 190px;
      border-right: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .not-found-grid > a:last-child {
      border-bottom: 0;
    }

    .not-found-actions {
      align-items: stretch;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
